snapcn components (https://snapcn.dev), a Shadcn Labs project maintained by Sri Nath.
Installed with `npx shadcn@latest add @snapcn/<name>` (components.json has "tsx": false):
text-reveal, text-highlight, terminal-simulator, word-captions, status-cycle, and their
core in ../../lib/snap-cn-ui.

Local patches, each marked "visual-explainer patch" in the source:
- lib/snap-cn-ui/fonts.js, word-captions.jsx, status-cycle.jsx: system font stacks instead of
  @remotion/google-fonts, so a render needs no network.
- terminal-simulator.jsx: a `viewport` prop (the size that the camera centres in) and a row
  height that follows the font size.

